# pnpm configuration for the kanban-board workspace.
#
# Per-project pnpm settings live in pnpm-workspace.yaml, not here. pnpm only
# reads authentication and registry settings from .npmrc files, so this file
# exists to hold the registry credentials (none needed for this project) and
# to document the one behaviour that is easy to trip over:
#
# The repo pins the package manager in package.json:
#
#     "packageManager": "pnpm@12.23.0"
#
# pnpm honours that field and will fetch and use the pinned version, so you do
# not need Corepack installed - and Corepack is no longer bundled with Node 26.
#
# `engine-strict` is deliberately left off. The repo targets Node 26.13.1
# (see .nvmrc), but a warning is friendlier than a hard install failure for
# anyone running an older Node on their machine. CI pins the exact version.
